igel.com/en/igel-os-base-system/current/igel-discovery-service-configuratio=
n-in-igel-os" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>System &gt; Update &gt; IGEL Discove=
ry</strong></a></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"1e24da53-b421-40ec-a=
0c7-17f3c5d4c0b8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3bdcfa278dad">Discovery Port</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"a9aa0a2d-7982-498c-9=
824-a2c3be3cd16f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b30a1773220">Same on all devices (default <strong>22336</st=
rong>)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a622b321-d8d2-4888-bd86-8aa5ab4b26b4">
